Off-host replication (litestream) — live verification record
Goal: Wire continuous off-host replication for the micro2 db-gateway backup.
Target: micro2 (145.241.238.20)   Recorded: 2026-10-15 (~17:50 UTC)

Each section below is verbatim stdout from the stated command except where
noted. No credential value appears anywhere in this record; the only-copy
check (section 6) reads the secret inside the host process and prints only
a verdict.

