Live-database definition (from scripts/install-litestream.sh, unchanged):
the set registered in the gateway's own registry, `dg list` -- the
metadata.sqlite registry itself is excluded by design because the running
gateway writes it in WAL mode and the hourly on-host backup set already
protects it:

$ ssh micro2 'sudo -n -u dg /usr/local/bin/dg --key-file /etc/dg/owner.key list'
{"databases":["verify_probe"]}

